cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use anarcism, please cite it together with ANARCI, HMMER, and IMGT, whose methods and data it reimplements. Their references are listed below.
title: anarcism
type: software
abstract: >-
  Independent reimplementation of ANARCI that recognizes and IMGT-numbers antibody and T-cell-receptor variable domains, with a self-contained Rust engine for Python and WebAssembly.
authors:
  - given-names: Moritz
    family-names: Onken
    affiliation: Revanta Inc
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/revanta-inc/anarcism"
